---
// src/components/MythBusterFlip.astro
// 👑 EDITORIAL UPGRADE: Interactive Fact-Check Matrix (Agent Fiction vs Sovereign Reality)
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 font-sans relative overflow-hidden" id="myth-buster-section">
  
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-rose-700 mb-4 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        Institutional Truth Matrix
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-900 font-medium leading-[1.18] tracking-tight mb-5">
        Declassifying the <br class="hidden sm:block"/>
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 via-amber-600 to-rose-700 font-semibold italic">Great Abroad Illusions.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed">
        Unethical contractors thrive on information asymmetry. Compare common agency sales pitches directly against official European education frameworks and statutory NMC gazettes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Column Fact-Check Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Fact Check 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <!-- Header Badge -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">Case Audit #01</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 border border-rose-200">Financial Trap</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Contractor Pitch (Red Box) -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-rose-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-5 shadow-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
              The Contractor Pitch
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-800 font-serif italic text-base leading-snug">
              "We guarantee 100% MBBS in a top European University for just ₹15 Lakhs total package."
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Sovereign Reality (Emerald Box) -->
          <div class="bg-emerald-950 text-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-inner">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              The Finesse Reality
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2">The Hidden ₹12L Escalation Trap</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">
              No sovereign university charges under ₹25L–₹35L for genuine English clinical training. Agents artificially suppress 1st-year numbers to trap students abroad.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-emerald-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-300">
              <span>Standard: Direct University Billing</span>
              <span class="font-bold">100% Transparent</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Citation Footer -->
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px]">Citation: EHEA Fee Transparency</span>
          <a href="/intelligence" class="text-emerald-700 font-bold hover:underline">Read Audit →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fact Check 2 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <!-- Header Badge -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">Case Audit #02</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 border border-rose-200">Legal Disqualification</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Contractor Pitch (Red Box) -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-rose-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-5 shadow-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
              The Contractor Pitch
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-800 font-serif italic text-base leading-snug">
              "Bilingual courses (English 1st year + local language clinicals) are perfectly valid for India."
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Sovereign Reality (Emerald Box) -->
          <div class="bg-emerald-950 text-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-inner">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              The Finesse Reality
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2">Automatic NMC Rejection</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">
              NMC Gazette 2021 strictly mandates 100% of the entire 54-month curriculum and hospital rotations be delivered solely in English medium.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-emerald-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-300">
              <span>Standard: NMC 2021 Clause 4</span>
              <span class="font-bold">Strict Compliance</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Citation Footer -->
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px]">Citation: Gazette No. UGMEB/2021</span>
          <a href="/intelligence" class="text-emerald-700 font-bold hover:underline">Read Audit →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fact Check 3 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <!-- Header Badge -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">Case Audit #03</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 border border-rose-200">Marketing Gimmick</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Contractor Pitch (Red Box) -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-rose-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-5 shadow-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
              The Contractor Pitch
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-800 font-serif italic text-base leading-snug">
              "Because of your NEET score, our exclusive agency connection approved a 50% tuition scholarship."
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Sovereign Reality (Emerald Box) -->
          <div class="bg-emerald-950 text-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-inner">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              The Finesse Reality
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2">The Phantom Commission Discount</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Sovereign government universities do not grant NEET-based scholarships to international students. The "scholarship" is just an inflated margin discount.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-emerald-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-300">
              <span>Standard: Official Rector Ledger</span>
              <span class="font-bold">Zero Markup</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Citation Footer -->
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px]">Citation: Sovereign University Statutes</span>
          <a href="/intelligence" class="text-emerald-700 font-bold hover:underline">Read Audit →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>